abstract: >-
  Unconditional proof of Proposition (1 - 1.67539) for the twin prime problem,
  combining Runbo Li's 1.2759 Chen lower bound with a self-contained positive
  upper-sieve majorant at distribution level 5/8 and a pure-integer directed
  certificate at denominator 2^80.
